            "quote": "化工行业兼具周期与成长属性",
            "start": 116,
            "end": 129
          }
        ],
        "unknown_fields": [
          "temporal_frame"
        ]
      },
      {
        "item_id": "itm_31b6d79c259707fd",
        "text": "化工品景气的本质是盈利改善，主要观察价差变化；原料价格波动较大时应重点观察产品价差。",
        "semantic_type": "opinion",
        "statement_role": "claim",
        "speech_role": "statement",
        "perspective": "source_explicit",
        "speaker_ref": "spk_b30c01880ad2",
        "polarity": "affirmed",
        "value": null,
        "behavior_status": null,
        "temporal_frame": "unknown",
        "evidence": [
          {
            "source_rev": "174b64628f35aca6",
            "packet_id": "25e44cc9136ec5bd186871eb5774c80c45460b93cbe3e786c55867dc9264e1f9",
            "locator": "3",
            "quote": "化工品景气的本质是盈利改善，主要观察价差变化",
            "start": 221,
            "end": 243
          }
        ],
        "unknown_fields": [
          "temporal_frame"
        ]
      },
      {
        "item_id": "itm_3f9df93fd96e506c",
        "text": "研究某一子行业应明确其下游用途，梳理供需变化；行业筛选应转向基于供需平衡表的自下而上比较。",
        "semantic_type": "opinion",
        "statement_role": "claim",
        "speech_role": "statement",
        "perspective": "source_explicit",
        "speaker_ref": "spk_b30c01880ad2",
        "polarity": "affirmed",
        "value": null,
        "behavior_status": null,
        "temporal_frame": "unknown",
        "evidence": [
          {
            "source_rev": "174b64628f35aca6",
            "packet_id": "25e44cc9136ec5bd186871eb5774c80c45460b93cbe3e786c55867dc9264e1f9",
            "locator": "3",
            "quote": "逐步转向基于供需平衡表的自下而上比较",
            "start": 390,
            "end": 408
          }
        ],
        "unknown_fields": [
          "temporal_frame"
        ]
      },
      {
        "item_id": "itm_56da45cd99919ef5",
        "text": "随着中国经济增长回归新常态，全球GDP增速放缓，需求对景气的拉动弱于以往，未来着眼点应放在供给增速。",
        "semantic_type": "opinion",
        "statement_role": "claim",
        "speech_role": "statement",
        "perspective": "source_explicit",
        "speaker_ref": "spk_b30c01880ad2",
        "polarity": "affirmed",
        "value": null,
        "behavior_status": null,
        "temporal_frame": "unknown",
        "evidence": [
          {
            "source_rev": "174b64628f35aca6",
            "packet_id": "25e44cc9136ec5bd186871eb5774c80c45460b93cbe3e786c55867dc9264e1f9",
            "locator": "3",
            "quote": "需求对景气的拉动弱于以往",
            "start": 459,
            "end": 471
          }
        ],
        "unknown_fields": [
          "temporal_frame"
        ]
      },
      {
        "item_id": "itm_e91824fb00cd3f5e",
        "text": "具有贸易属性的化工品需求应立足全球；供给应重点关注国内新增产能。",
        "semantic_type": "opinion",
        "statement_role": "claim",
        "speech_role": "statement",
        "perspective": "source_explicit",
        "speaker_ref": "spk_b30c01880ad2",
        "polarity": "affirmed",
        "value": null,
        "behavior_status": null,
        "temporal_frame": "unknown",
        "evidence": [
          {
            "source_rev": "174b64628f35aca6",
            "packet_id": "25e44cc9136ec5bd186871eb5774c80c45460b93cbe3e786c55867dc9264e1f9",
            "locator": "3",
            "quote": "供给应重点关注国内新增产能",
            "start": 613,
            "end": 626
          }
        ],
        "unknown_fields": [
          "temporal_frame"
        ]
      },
      {
        "item_id": "itm_100a32f0d5dea281",
        "text": "行业集中度提升推高开工率中枢，80-90%的开工率接近历史较高水平也不一定代表供给紧张，行业景气未必上升。",
        "semantic_type": "opinion",
        "statement_role": "claim",
        "speech_role": "statement",
        "perspective": "source_explicit",
        "speaker_ref": "spk_b30c01880ad2",
        "polarity": "mixed",
        "value": null,
        "behavior_status": null,
        "temporal_frame": "unknown",
        "evidence": [
          {
            "source_rev": "174b64628f35aca6",
            "packet_id": "25e44cc9136ec5bd186871eb5774c80c45460b93cbe3e786c55867dc9264e1f9",
            "locator": "3",
            "quote": "也不一定代表供给紧张，行业景气未必上升",
            "start": 720,
            "end": 739
          }
        ],
        "unknown_fields": [
          "temporal_frame"
        ]
      },
      {
        "item_id": "itm_cddaf2d148965227",
        "text": "价格底部主要改善长期赔率，并不一定等同于中期拐点；价格处于高位也不必然构成卖点。",
        "semantic_type": "opinion",
        "statement_role": "claim",
        "speech_role": "statement",
        "perspective": "source_explicit",
        "speaker_ref": "spk_b30c01880ad2",
        "polarity": "mixed",
        "value": null,
        "behavior_status": null,
        "temporal_frame": "unknown",
        "evidence": [
          {
            "source_rev": "174b64628f35aca6",
            "packet_id": "25e44cc9136ec5bd186871eb5774c80c45460b93cbe3e786c55867dc9264e1f9",
            "locator": "3",
            "quote": "并不一定等同于中期拐点",
            "start": 790,
            "end": 801
          }
        ],
        "unknown_fields": [
          "temporal_frame"
        ]
      },
      {
        "item_id": "itm_90383f69bb59adda",
        "text": "未来的新增产能不应否定当前明确的景气阶段，只要未来一至两年供需持续改善，行业仍具备周期投资价值。",
        "semantic_type": "opinion",
        "statement_role": "claim",
        "speech_role": "statement",
        "perspective": "source_explicit",
        "speaker_ref": "spk_b30c01880ad2",
        "polarity": "affirmed",
        "value": null,
        "behavior_status": null,
        "temporal_frame": "unknown",
        "evidence": [
          {
            "source_rev": "174b64628f35aca6",
            "packet_id": "25e44cc9136ec5bd186871eb5774c80c45460b93cbe3e786c55867dc9264e1f9",
            "locator": "3",
            "quote": "只要未来一至两年供需持续改善，行业仍具备周期投资价值",
            "start": 948,
            "end": 974
          }
        ],
        "unknown_fields": [
          "temporal_frame"
        ]
      },
      {
        "item_id": "itm_6d1fd250f1aad656",
        "text": "对景气上行期行业，应优先比较相关公司产品产能与市值的弹性，并综合考察盈利情况、成本优势。",
        "semantic_type": "opinion",
        "statement_role": "claim",
        "speech_role": "statement",
        "perspective": "source_explicit",
        "speaker_ref": "spk_b30c01880ad2",
        "polarity": "affirmed",
        "value": null,
        "behavior_status": null,
        "temporal_frame": "unknown",
        "evidence": [
          {
            "source_rev": "174b64628f35aca6",
            "packet_id": "25e44cc9136ec5bd186871eb5774c80c45460b93cbe3e786c55867dc9264e1f9",
            "locator": "3",
            "quote": "应优先比较相关公司产品产能与市值的弹性",
            "start": 1019,
            "end": 1038
          }
        ],
        "unknown_fields": [
          "temporal_frame"
        ]
      },
      {
        "item_id": "itm_4574fac58a584972",
        "text": "市值已反映较高涨价预期时的两种思路：跟踪供需变化预测价格趋势做决策；或参考产品高位历史价格分析触及可能性和空间。",
        "semantic_type": "opinion",
        "statement_role": "claim",
        "speech_role": "statement",
        "perspective": "source_explicit",
        "speaker_ref": "spk_b30c01880ad2",
        "polarity": "affirmed",
        "value": null,
        "behavior_status": null,
        "temporal_frame": "unknown",
        "evidence": [
          {
            "source_rev": "174b64628f35aca6",
            "packet_id": "25e44cc9136ec5bd186871eb5774c80c45460b93cbe3e786c55867dc9264e1f9",
            "locator": "3",
            "quote": "有两种思路可供参考",
            "start": 1120,
            "end": 1129
          }
        ],
        "unknown_fields": [
          "temporal_frame"
        ]
      },
      {
        "item_id": "itm_46663b2daf8730ca",
        "text": "风险提示：供给端政策执行力度不及预期；海外需求不及预期；全球地缘政治动荡；技术风险。",
        "semantic_type": "fact",
        "statement_role": "risk",
        "speech_role": "statement",
        "perspective": "source_explicit",
        "speaker_ref": "spk_b30c01880ad2",
